This repository contains a Go proxy and an embedded copy of the upstream
FreeRDP WASM web client. The client is redistributed under the terms of its
respective upstream licenses.

Embedded client (proxy/site/)
-----------------------------
Source:    https://github.com/congzhangzh/freerdp-web (Apache-2.0)
           commit (see proxy/site/MANIFEST for the pinned upstream commit)
Binary:    https://github.com/congzhangzh/rdp-release-kit
           newest web-* release with freerdp-web-page.zip, resolved at build
           time by scripts/fetch-client.sh (SHA-256 verified). The patched
           frontend is committed here as a reference copy; builds refresh it
           from upstream and re-apply scripts/patch-client.sh.
License:   Apache License 2.0 — see proxy/site/LICENSE.upstream
Details:   proxy/site/MANIFEST lists all third-party components and their
           pinned source revisions; their licenses are in proxy/site/licenses/.

Modifications
-------------
proxy/site/app.js was patched locally to support a full ws(s)://.../ws gateway
URL (workaround for Emscripten issue #27886 in the prebuilt multi-threaded
client). The unmodified upstream file is kept as proxy/site/app.js.orig for
reference. The patch is reproducible via scripts/patch-client.sh, which is run
automatically by build.sh after each upstream refresh.

